## Tool Choice

```python
response = client.messages.create(
    model="claude-opus-4-7",
    max_tokens=16000,
    tools=tools,
    tool_choice={"type": "tool", "name": "get_weather"},  # Force specific tool
    messages=[{"role": "user", "content": "What's the weather in Paris?"}]
